# THREAD CONTEXT

Thread is the core entity.

## STRUCTURE

Thread:
- belongs to Project
- has Discipline
- has Level
- has Typology

## RULES

- A thread represents ONE technical topic
- Cannot be duplicated with same attributes

## UNIQUE CONSTRAINT

(projectId + discipline + level + typology)

## PURPOSE

Acts as:
- container
- approval unit
- traceability unit